 # 数据库服务\n  postgres:\n    image: postgres:14\n    environment:\n      - POSTGRES_DB=coze\n      - POSTGRES_USER=user\n      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=pass\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    networks:\n      - coze-network\n\n  # Redis缓存\n  redis:\n    image: redis:6-alpine\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n    networks:\n      - coze-network\n\n  # 监控服务\n  prometheus:\n    image: prom/prometheus:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"9090:9090\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\n    networks:\n      - coze-network\n\n  grafana:\n    image: grafana/grafana:latest\n    ports:\n      - \"3001:3000\"\n    environment:\n      - GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin\n    depends_on:\n      - prometheus\n    networks:\n      - coze-network\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_data:\n  redis_data:\n\nnetworks:\n  coze-network:\n    driver: bridge\n```\n\nKubernetes部署配置\n\n```yaml\n# k8s-deployment.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: coze-backend\n  namespace: coze-production\nspec:\n  replicas: 3\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: coze-backend\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: coze-backend\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: coze-backend\n        image: coze-backend:10.1.0\n        ports:\n        - containerPort: 8080\n        env:\n        - name: DATABASE_URL\n          valueFrom:\n            secretKeyRef:\n              name: coze-secrets\n              key: database-url\n        - name: JWT_SECRET\n          valueFrom:\n            secretKeyRef:\n              name: coze-secrets\n              key: jwt-secret\n        resources:\n          requests:\n            memory: \"512Mi\"\n            cpu: \"250m\"\n          limits:\n            memory: \"1Gi\"\n            cpu: \"500m\"\n        livenessProbe:\n          httpGet:\n            path: /health\n            port: 8080\n          initialDelaySeconds: 30\n          periodSeconds: 10\n        readinessProbe:\n          httpGet:\n            path: /ready\n            port: 8080\n          initialDelaySeconds: 5\n          periodSeconds: 5\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: coze-backend-service\n  namespace: coze-production\nspec:\n  selector:\n    app: coze-backend\n  ports:\n  - port: 80\n    targetPort: 8080\n  type: LoadBalancer\n```\n\n📋 完整API端点列表\n\n核心API端点\n\n· POST /v1/chat - 智能对话接口\n· POST /v1/workflows - 工作流管理\n· POST /v1/media/generate - 媒体生成\n· POST /v1/code/fix - 代码修复\n· POST /v1/plugins - 插件管理\n· GET /v1/health - 系统健康检查\n\n扩展API端点\n\n· POST /v1/automation/execute - 自动化执行\n· GET /v1/analytics/dashboard - 数据分析\n· POST /v1/integration/webhook - Webhook集成\n· WS /v1/realtime/stream - 实时数据流\n· GET /v1/templates - 模板管理\n· POST /v1/batch/process - 批量处理\n\n管理API端点\n\n· GET /v1/admin/users - 用户管理\n· POST /v1/admin/plugins - 插件审核\n· GET /v1/admin/metrics - 系统指标\n· POST /v1/admin/backup - 数据备份\n\n🚀 完整快速开始指南\n\n环境准备\n\n```bash\n# 1. 系统要求检查\nnode --version  # 需要 18.0+\ndocker --version  # 需要 20.0+\ndocker-compose --version  # 需要 1.29+\n```\n\n本地开发部署\n\n```bash\n# 1. 克隆项目仓库\ngit clone https://github.com/coze/super-hub.git\ncd super-hub\n\n# 2. 环境配置设置\ncp .env.example .env\n# 编辑 .env 文件配置数据库和API密钥\n\n# 3. 安装依赖\nnpm install\n\n# 4. 启动开发服务\nnpm run dev\n\n# 5. 访问系统\nopen http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n生产环境部署\n\n```bash\n# 1. 构建Docker镜像\ndocker build -t coze-super-hub:10.1.0 .\n\n# 2. 启动所有服务\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n# 3. 检查服务状态\ndocker-compose ps\n\n# 4. 查看日志\ndocker-compose logs -f\n\n# 5. 运行健康检查\ncurl http://localhost:8080/health\n```\n\n🔒 完整安全配置\n\nJWT配置\n\n```javascript\n// config/jwt.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET || 'your-super-secret-key',\n  expiresIn: '24h',\n  issuer: 'coze-platform',\n  audience: 'coze-users'\n};\n```\n\nCORS配置\n\n```javascript\n// config/cors.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  origin: [\n    'https://coze.com',\n    'https://www.coze.com',\n    'https://api.coze.com'\n  ],\n  methods: ['GET', '