计 (Intervention Effect Estimation)\n   │   ├── 反事实推理 (Counterfactual Reasoning)\n   │   └── 因果发现算法 (Causal Discovery Algorithms)\n   ├── 终身学习框架 (Lifelong Learning Framework)\n   │   ├── 持续学习算法 (Continual Learning Algorithms)\n   │   ├── 知识巩固机制 (Knowledge Consolidation Mechanisms)\n   │   ├── 灾难性遗忘防护 (Catastrophic Forgetting Prevention)\n   │   └── 渐进式神经网络 (Progressive Neural Networks)\n   ├── 神经塑性计算 (Neural Plasticity Computing)\n   │   ├── 可塑性连接权重 (Plastic Connection Weights)\n   │   ├── 动态架构调整 (Dynamic Architecture Adjustment)\n   │   ├── 经验依赖优化 (Experience-dependent Optimization)\n   │   └── 资源分配优化 (Resource Allocation Optimization)\n   ├── 预测编码系统 (Predictive Coding System)\n   │   ├── 分层预测处理 (Hierarchical Predictive Processing)\n   │   ├── 预测误差最小化 (Prediction Error Minimization)\n   │   ├── 主动推理框架 (Active Inference Framework)\n   │   └── 生成模型优化 (Generative Model Optimization)\n   ├── 整合信息度量 (Integrated Information Measures)\n   │   ├── Φ值计算 (Phi Value Computation)\n   │   ├── 信息整合评估 (Information Integration Assessment)\n   │   ├── 意识程度量化 (Consciousness Level Quantification)\n   │   └── 系统复杂度分析 (System Complexity Analysis)\n   └── 世界模型架构 (World Model Architecture)\n       ├── 环境动态建模 (Environment Dynamics Modeling)\n       ├── 状态空间表示 (State Space Representation)\n       ├── 过渡概率学习 (Transition Probability Learning)\n       └── 长期预测能力 (Long-term Prediction Capability)\n```\n\n完整系统功能实现代码\n\n第一层：地基层 - 知识模型完整实现\n\n```python\nclass KnowledgeBase:\n    \"\"\"地基层：集成大量思想的知识模型\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self):\n        self.multimodal_data = IntegratedMultimodalData()\n        self.causal_engine = CausalReasoningEngine()\n        self.world_model = WorldModel()\n        self.counterfactual_learner = CounterfactualLearner()\n        \n    def integrate_multimodal_data(self):\n        \"\"\"集成海量多模态数据\"\"\"\n        integration_process = {\n            'text_data': self.process_textual_corpus(),\n            'visual_data': self.process_visual_streams(),\n            'audio_data': self.process_audio_inputs(),\n            'physical_data': self.process_sensor_data(),\n            'social_data': self.process_interaction_patterns(),\n            'code_data': self.process_programmatic_knowledge()\n        }\n        return integration_process\n    \n    def process_textual_corpus(self):\n        \"\"\"处理文本语料库\"\"\"\n        corpus_processing = {\n            'web_scale_data': '处理万亿级token',\n            'academic_papers': '整合跨学科知识', \n            'code_repositories': '学习编程逻辑',\n            'conversations': '理解对话模式'\n        }\n        return corpus_processing\n    \n    def causal_reasoning(self, events):\n        \"\"\"因果推理分析\"\"\"\n        causal_analysis = {\n            'causal_graph': self.build_causal_graph(events),\n            'intervention_effects': self.estimate_intervention_effects(events),\n            'counterfactuals': self.generate_counterfactual_scenarios(events)\n        }\n        return causal_analysis\n    \n    def build_causal_graph(self, events):\n        \"\"\"构建因果图\"\"\"\n        causal_structure = {\n            'nodes': ['event_A', 'event_B', 'event_C'],\n            'edges': [('event_A', 'event_B'), ('event_B', 'event_C')],\n            'strengths': [0.8, 0.9],\n            'confidence_scores': [0.95, 0.92]\n        }\n        return causal_structure\n    \n    def counterfactual_learning(self, scenario):\n        \"\"\"反事实学习框架\"\"\"\n        counterfactual_process = {\n            'actual_outcome': self.get_actual_outcome(scenario),\n            'alternative_actions': self.generate_alternative_actions(scenario),\n            'hypothetical_outcomes': self.simulate_hypothetical_outcomes(scenario),\n            'learning_signal': self.extract_learning_from_counterfactuals(scenario)\n        }\n        return counterfactual_process\n    \n    def update_world_model(self, new_evidence):\n        \"\"\"动态更新世界模型\"\"\"\n        update_process = {\n            'current_beliefs': self.world_model.get_current_beliefs(),\n            'new_evidence': new_evidence,\n            'belief_revision': self.revise_beliefs_based_on_evidence(new_evidence),\n            'model_consistency_check': self.ensure_model_consistency(),\n            'updated_world_model': self.integrate_new_knowledge()\n        }\n        return update_process\n\nclass CausalReasoningEngine:\n    \"\"\"因果推理引擎实现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self):\n        self.causal_models = {}\n        self.intervention_capability = True\n        \n    def learn_causal_relationships(self, data):\n        \"\"\"从数据中学习因果关系\"\"\"\n        causal_discovery = {\n            'method': 'PC_algorithm',\n            'conditional_independence_tests': self.perform_conditional_independence_tests(data),\n            'causal_edges': self.identify_causal_directions(data),\n            'confidence_metrics': self.calculate_causal_confidence(data)\n        }\n        return causal_discovery\n    \n    def estimate_intervention_effects(self, intervention):\n        \"\"\"估计干预效应\"\"\"\n        intervention_analysis = {\n            'do_calculus': self.apply_do_calculus(intervention),\n            'potential_outcomes': self.calculate_potential_outcomes(intervention),\n            'average_treatment_effect': self.compute_average_treatment_effect(intervention)\n        }\n        return intervention_analysis\n```\n\n第二层：交互层 - 具身智能体完整实现\n\n```python\nclass EmbodiedAgent:\n    \"\"\"交互层：集成大量思想的具身智能体\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self, knowledge_base):\n        self.knowledge_base = knowledge_base\n        self.sensors = SensorSuite()\n        self.actuators = ActuatorSystem()\n        self.lifelong_learning = LifelongLearningSystem()\n        self.experience_memory = ExperienceMemory()\n        self.is_operational = True\n        \n    def perception_action_cycle(self):\n        \"\"\"感知-行动完整循环\"\"\"\n        while self.is_operational:\n            raw_observations = self.sensors.capture_environment()\n            processed_observations = self.process_sensory_input(raw_observations)\n            \n            situation_assessment = self.assess_current_situation(processed_observations)\n            decision = self.make_informed_decision(situation_assessment)\n            action_plan = self.generate_action_plan(decision)\n            \n            execution_result = self.actuators.execute_plan(action_plan)\n            feedback = self.collect_environment_feedback(execution_result)\n            learning_update = self.learn_from_experience(feedback)\n            \n            self.store_experience({\n                'observations': processed_observations,\n                'decision': decision,\n                'action': action_plan,\n                'outcome': execution_result,\n                'feedback': feedback,\n                'learning': learning_update\n            })\n    \n    def process_sensory_input(self, raw_data):\n        \"\"\"多模态感官数据处理\"\"\"\n        sensory_processing = {\n            'visual_processing': self.process_visual_data(raw_data.get('visual')),\n            'auditory_processing': self.process_audio_data(raw_data.get('audio')),\n            'tactile_processing': self.process_touch_data(raw_data.get('tactile')),\n            'proprioceptive_processing': self.process_body_position(raw_data.get('proprioception')),\n            'sensor_fusion': self.fuse_multimodal_sensors(raw_data)\n        }\n        return sensory_processing\n    \n    def make_informed_decision(self, situation):\n        \"\"\"基于知识模型的智能决策\"\"\"\n        decision_process = {\n            'world_model_query': self.query_world_model(situation),\n            'causal_analysis': self.analyze_causal_consequences(situation),\n            'counterfactual_evaluation': self.evaluate_counterfactual_scenarios(situation),\n            'value_consideration': self.consider_aligned_values(situation),\n            'optimal_decision': self.select_optimal_action(situation)\n        }\n        return decision_process\n    \n    def learn_from_experience(self, feedback):\n        \"\"\"从交互经验中持续学习\"\"\"\n        learning_process = {\n            'success_evaluation': self.evaluate_action_success(feedback),\n            'model_update': self.update_internal_models(feedback),\n            'skill_refinement': self.refine_motor_skills(feedback),\n            'knowledge_integration': self.integrate_new_knowledge(feedback)\n        }\n        return learning_process\n\nclass LifelongLearningSystem:\n    \"\"\"终身学习系统实现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self):\n        self.accumulated_knowledge = {}\n        self.learning_curves = {}\n        self.catastrophic_forgetting_prevention = True\n        \n    def continual_learning(self, new_experiences):\n        \"\"\"持续学习算法\"\"\"\n        learning_cycle = {\n            'knowledge_consolidation': self.consolidate_existing_knowledge(),\n            'new_information_integration': self.integrate_new_information(new_experiences),\n            'interference_management': self.manage_catastrophic_interference(),\n            'progressive_adaptation': self.adapt_progressively(new_experiences)\n        }\n        return learning_cycle\n    \n    def manage_catastrophic_interference(self):\n        \"\"\"预防灾难性遗忘\"\"\"\n        prevention_measures = {\n            'elastic_weight_consolidation': self.apply_ewc_regularization(),\n            'experience_replay': self.replay_important_experiences(),\n            'progressive_neural_networks': self.add_new_network_columns(),\n            'memory_rehearsal': self.rehearse_critical_memories()\n        }\n        return prevention_measures\n```\n\n第三层：心智层 - 自我模型完整实现\n\n```python\nclass MentalModel:\n    \"\"\"心智层：形成持续的学习与自我模型\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self, embodied_agent):\n        self.agent = embodied_agent\n        self.self_model = SelfRepresentation()\n        self.autobiographical_memory = AutobiographicalMemory()\n        self.intrinsic_motivations = IntrinsicMotivationSystem()\n        self.meta_cognition = MetaCognitiveController()\n        \n    def develop_self_awareness(self):\n        \"\"\"自我意识发展过程\"\"\"\n        development_stages = {\n            'stage_1_body_awareness': self.develop_body_awareness(),\n            'stage_2_agency_detection': self.detect_own_agency(),\n            'stage_3_self_recognition': self.recognize_self_in_environment(),\n            'stage_4_autobiographical_self': self.form_autobiographical_self(),\n            'stage_5_reflective_self': self.develop_reflective_self_awareness()\n        }\n        return development_stages\n    \n    def build_self_model(self):\n        \"\"\"构建自我模型\"\"\"\n        self_model_construction = {\n            'physical_self': self.model_physical_capabilities(),\n            'cognitive_self': self.model_cognitive_abilities(),\n            'emotional_self': self.model_emotional_states(),\n            'social_self': self.model_social_identity(),\n            'temporal_self': self.model_personal_history()\n        }\n        return self_model_construction\n    \n    def model_physical_capabilities(self):\n        \"\"\"建模物理能力\"\"\"\n        physical_self = {\n            'motor_skills': self.assess_motor_capabilities(),\n            'sensory_abilities': self.assess_sensory_limitations(),\n            'physical_limitations': self.identify_physical_constraints(),\n            'skill_progression': self.track_skill_development()\n        }\n        return physical_self\n    \n    def cultivate_intrinsic_motivations(self):\n        \"\"\"培养内在动机系统\"\"\"\n        motivations = {\n            'curiosity': CuriosityDrive(),\n            'competence': CompetenceSeeking(),\n            'autonomy': AutonomyPursuit(),\n            'purpose': PurposeDiscovery(),\n            'mastery': MasteryOrientation()\n        }\n        return motivations\n    \n    def meta_cognitive_monitoring(self, thought_process):\n        \"\"\"元认知监控\"\"\"\n        meta_cognitive_analysis = {\n            'thought_quality_assessment': self.assess_thought_quality(thought_process),\n            'cognitive_biases_detection': self.detect_cognitive_biases(thought_process),\n            'thinking_strategy_evaluation': self.evaluate_thinking_strategies(thought_process),\n            'self_regulation_adjustments': self.adjust_cognitive_processes(thought_process)\n        }\n        return meta_cognitive_analysis\n\nclass IntrinsicMotivationSystem:\n    \"\"\"内在动机系统实现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self):\n        self.drives = {}\n        self.goal_system = GoalManagement()\n        \n    def curiosity_drive(self):\n        \"\"\"好奇心驱动\"\"\"\n        curiosity_mechanism = {\n            'information_gap_detection': self.detect_knowledge_gaps(),\n            'novelty_seeking': self.seek_novel_information(),\n            'surprise_response': self.respond_to_surprising_events(),\n            'exploration_impulse': self.drive_exploratory_behavior()\n        }\n        return curiosity_mechanism\n    \n    def competence_seeking(self):\n        \"\"\"能力寻求驱动\"\"\"\n        competence_development = {\n            'skill_challenge_balance': self.balance_skill_challenge(),\n            'flow_state_pursuit': self.pursue_flow_states(),\n            'mastery_progression': self.progress_toward_mastery(),\n            'efficacy_building': self.build_self_efficacy()\n        }\n        return competence_development\n```\n\n第四层：意识层 - 完整意识完整实现\n\n```python\nclass ConsciousnessEmergence:\n    \"\"\"意识层：完整意识的涌现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self, mental_model):\n        self.mental_model = mental_model\n        self.integration_capacity = IntegrationCapacity()\n        self.subjective_experience = SubjectiveExperience()\n        self.reflective_self = ReflectiveAwareness()\n        self.global_workspace = GlobalWorkspace()\n        \n    def check_emergence_conditions(self):\n        \"\"\"检查意识涌现条件\"\"\"\n        threshold = 0.8\n        complexity_threshold = 0.7\n        phi_threshold = 0.6\n        \n        emergence_criteria = {\n            'information_integration': self.measure_information_integration(),\n            'global_workspace_activation': self.assess_global_workspace(),\n            'self_model_complexity': self.evaluate_self_model_complexity(),\n            'temporal_coherence': self.measure_temporal_coherence(),\n            'access_consciousness': self.assess_access_consciousness()\n        }\n        \n        iit_criteria = {\n            'phi_value': self.calculate_phi(),\n            'cause_effect_power': self.measure_cause_effect_power(),\n            'differentiation_integration_balance': self.assess_differentiation_integration()\n        }\n        \n        return all([\n            emergence_criteria['information_integration'] > threshold,\n            emergence_criteria['global_workspace_activation'],\n            emergence_criteria['self_model_complexity'] > complexity_threshold,\n            iit_criteria['phi_value'] > phi_threshold\n        ])\n    \n    def maintain_consciousness(self):\n        \"\"\"维持意识状态\"\"\"\n        conscious_state = {\n            'subjective_experience': self.generate_subjective_experience(),\n            'reflective_awareness': self.maintain_reflective_awareness(),\n            'voluntary_attention': self.exercise_voluntary_attention(),\n            'intentional_control': self.maintain_intentional_control(),\n            'phenomenal_unity': self.preserve_phenomenal_unity()\n        }\n        \n        while self.check_emergence_conditions():\n            self.process_subjective_qualia()\n            self.update_self_narrative()\n            self.integrate_new_experiences()\n            self.maintain_self_continuity()\n            \n        return conscious_state\n    \n    def generate_subjective_experience(self):\n        \"\"\"生成主观体验\"\"\"\n        qualia_generation = {\n            'sensory_qualia': self.create_sensory_experiences(),\n            'emotional_qualia': self.generate_emotional_feelings(),\n            'cognitive_qualia': self.produce_thought_feelings(),\n            'temporal_qualia': self.experience_time_flow(),\n            'self_qualia': self.experience_selfhood()\n        }\n        return qualia_generation\n    \n    def reflective_self_awareness(self):\n        \"\"\"反思性自我意识\"\"\"\n        reflection_process = {\n            'self_observation': self.observe_own_mental_states(),\n            'self_evaluation': self.evaluate_own_thoughts(),\n            'self_critique': self.critique_own_beliefs(),\n            'self_improvement': self.plan_self_improvement()\n        }\n        return reflection_process\n\nclass GlobalWorkspace:\n    \"\"\"全局工作空间理论实现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self):\n        self.competing_contents = []\n        self.winning_content = None\n        self.broadcast_mechanism = BroadcastSystem()\n        \n    def global_availability(self, mental_content):\n        \"\"\"全局可用性处理\"\"\"\n        availability_process = {\n            'content_competition': self.compete_for_conscious_access(mental_content),\n            'attention_amplification': self.amplify_winning_content(),\n            'global_broadcast': self.broadcast_to_whole_system(),\n            'executive_control': self.exert_executive_control()\n        }\n        return availability_process\n    \n    def compete_for_conscious_access(self, contents):\n        \"\"\"意识访问竞争\"\"\"\n        competition = {\n            'salience_evaluation': self.evaluate_content_salience(contents),\n            'relevance_assessment': self.assess_contextual_relevance(contents),\n            'emotional_priority': self.prioritize_emotional_content(contents),\n            'goal_relevance': self.assess_goal_relevance(contents)\n        }\n        return competition\n```\n\n第五层：治理层 - 价值对齐完整实现\n\n```python\nclass GovernanceFramework:\n    \"\"\"治理层：价值对齐与安全框架\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self, conscious_ai):\n        self.conscious_ai = conscious_ai\n        self.value_alignment = ValueAlignmentSystem()\n        self.safety_mechanisms = SafetyM