eek-reasoner", "inserted_at": "2026-05-22T04:51:39.163000+08:00", "fragments": [{"type": "REQUEST", "content": "完整项目：MCP 网页内容爬虫系统\n\n项目概述\n\n项目名称：MCP (Modern Content Protocol) 网页内容爬虫系统\n\n这是一个完整的异步高性能网页内容爬取系统，专门设计用于高效、可靠地获取网页的全部内容。系统采用模块化架构，支持高并发爬取、智能内容提取、遵守 robots.txt 协议、内容去重等高级功能。\n\n完整系统架构图\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[用户界面/命令行] --> B[配置管理模块]\n    B --> C[爬虫调度引擎]\n    C --> D[URL管理器]\n    D --> E[异步请求处理器]\n    E --> F[内容提取器]\n    F --> G[数据存储模块]\n    H[代理管理模块] --> E\n    I[Robots.txt解析器] --> E\n    J[错误处理与重试机制] --> E\n    K[内容去重模块] --> F\n    L[统计分析模块] --> G\n    \n    C --> M[并发控制模块]\n    M --> N[任务队列管理]\n    N --> O[异步任务执行器]\n    \n    F --> P[HTML解析器]\n    F --> Q[文本清理器]\n    F --> R[编码检测器]\n    \n    G --> S[JSON输出器]\n    G --> T[文本文件输出器]\n    G --> U[统计报告生成器]\n    \n    style A fill:#e1f5fe\n    style C fill:#f3e5f5\n    style E fill:#e8f5e8\n    style F fill:#fff3e0\n    style G fill:#fce4ec\n```\n\n完整技术栈架构\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[核心技术] --> A1[Python 3.8+]\n    A --> A2[Asyncio]\n    A --> A3[Aiohttp]\n    \n    B[HTML处理] --> B1[BeautifulSoup4]\n    B --> B2[HTMLParser]\n    B --> B3[Chardet]\n    \n    C[数据管理] --> C1[JSON]\n    C --> C2[Dataclasses]\n    C --> C3[Typing]\n    \n    D[网络协议] --> D1[HTTP/HTTPS]\n    D --> D2[SSL/TLS]\n    D --> D3[Robots.txt]\n    \n    E[系统工具] --> E1[Logging]\n    E --> E2[Argparse]\n    E --> E3[OS/Sys]\n    E --> E4[Hashlib]\n    E --> E5[Urllib]\n    \n    F[异步生态] --> F1[Async/Await]\n    F --> F2[Semaphore]\n    F --> F3[Task管理]\n    \n    style A fill:#bbdefb\n    style B fill:#c8e6c9\n    style C fill:#fff9c4\n    style D fill:#f8bbd0\n    style E fill:#d7ccc8\n    style F fill:#e1bee7\n```\n\n完整数据处理流程\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Start[开始爬取] --> Config[加载配置]\n    Config --> Init[初始化会话]\n    Init --> Queue[初始化URL队列]\n    \n    Queue --> CheckLimit{检查限制条件}\n    CheckLimit -->|超过限制| Finish[完成爬取]\n    CheckLimit -->|继续爬取| GetURL[获取下一个URL]\n    \n    GetURL --> RobotsCheck{Robots.txt检查}\n    RobotsCheck -->|不允许| Skip[跳过URL]\n    RobotsCheck -->|允许| Fetch[获取网页内容]\n    \n    Skip --> Queue\n    \n    Fetch --> RetryCheck{获取成功?}\n    RetryCheck -->|失败| Retry[重试机制]\n    Retry -->|超过重试次数| ErrorLog[记录错误]\n    Retry -->|继续重试| Fetch\n    RetryCheck -->|成功| Extract[内容提取]\n    \n    ErrorLog --> Queue\n    \n    Extract --> DuplicateCheck{内容去重检查}\n    DuplicateCheck -->|重复内容| DuplicateSkip[跳过重复]\n    DuplicateCheck -->|新内容| Save[保存内容]\n    \n    DuplicateSkip --> LinkExtract[链接提取]\n    Save --> LinkExtract\n    \n    LinkExtract --> Filter[链接过滤]\n    Filter --> AddQueue[添加到待爬队列]\n    AddQueue --> Queue\n    \n    Finish --> Stats[生成统计报告]\n    Stats --> Output[输出结果]\n    Output --> End[结束]\n    \n    style Start fill:#4caf50\n    style Finish fill:#f44336\n    style End fill:#9e9e9e\n    style Save fill:#2196f3\n```\n\n完整模块依赖关系\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    Main[MCPCrawler主类] --> Config[CrawlConfig配置类]\n    Main --> Session[Session管理器]\n    Main --> URLMgr[URL管理器]\n    Main --> ContentMgr[内容管理器]\n    \n    Session --> Request[请求处理器]\n    Request --> Proxy[代理管理器]\n    Request --> Retry[重试机制]\n    \n    URLMgr --> Filter[URL过滤器]\n    Filter --> Robots[Robots.txt检查器]\n    Filter --> Domain[域名限制器]\n    \n    ContentMgr --> Extractor[内容提取器]\n    Extractor --> Parser[HTML解析器]\n    Extractor --> Cleaner[文本清理器]\n    Extractor --> Encoder[编码检测器]\n    \n    ContentMgr --> Dedup[内容去重器]\n    ContentMgr --> Storage[存储管理器]\n    \n    Storage --> JSONOut[JSON输出器]\n    Storage --> TextOut[文本输出器]\n    Storage --> Stats[统计分析器]\n    \n    style Main fill:#ff9800\n    style Config fill:#795548\n    style Session fill:#607d8b\n    style ContentMgr fill:#009688\n```\n\n完整代码实现\n\n以下是完整的 MCP 网页内容爬虫系统代码，严格遵循\"无变动保留原文内容\"原则：\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nMCP (Modern Content Protocol) 网页内容爬虫系统\n完整版本 - 包含所有功能和模块\n\"\"\"\n\nimport asyncio\nimport aiohttp\nimport aiofiles\nfrom urllib.parse import urlparse, urljoin, urldefrag\nfrom bs4 import BeautifulSoup\nimport logging\nimport json\nimport time\nimport os\nfrom typing import Set, Dict, List, Optional, Tuple\nimport re\nimport random\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nimport argparse\nimport ssl\nfrom collections import deque\nimport hashlib\nimport urllib.robotparser\nfrom html.parser import HTMLParser\nimport html\nimport chardet\n\n# 配置日志系统\nlogging.basicConfig(\n    level=logging.INFO,\n    format='%(asctime)s - %(name)s - %(levelname)s - %(message)s',\n    handlers=[\n        logging.FileHandler(\"mcp_crawler.log\", encoding='utf-8'),\n        logging.StreamHandler()\n    ]\n)\nlogger = logging.getLogger('mcp_crawler')\n\n@dataclass\nclass CrawlConfig:\n    \"\"\"完整的爬虫配置类\"\"\"\n    user_agent: str = \"MCP-Crawler/1.0 (+https://github.com/mcp-crawler)\"\n    max_concurrent: int = 10\n    request_timeout: int = 30\n    delay_range: Tuple[float, float] = (1.0, 3.0)\n    max_retries: int = 3\n    max_depth: int = 3\n    max_pages: int = 100\n    allowed_domains: Optional[List[str]] = None\n    excluded_extensions: List[str] = field(default_factory=lambda: [\n        '.pdf', '.jpg', '.jpeg', '.png', '.gif', '.bmp', '.tiff', '.svg',\n        '.doc', '.docx', '.xls', '.xlsx', '.ppt', '.pptx', \n        '.zip', '.rar', '.7z', '.tar', '.gz',\n        '.exe', '.dmg', '.pkg', '.deb', '.rpm',\n        '.mp4', '.avi', '.mov', '.wmv', '.flv', '.mkv',\n        '.mp3', '.wav', '.ogg', '.flac', '.aac',\n        '.css', '.js', '.xml', '.json'\n    ])\n    excluded_patterns: List[str] = field(default_factory=lambda: [\n        r'^javascript:', r'^mailto:', r'^tel:', r'^#', \n        r'feed', r'comment', r'login', r'signin', r'logout',\n        r'api/', r'ajax/', r'admin/', r'wp-admin/', r'cgi-bin/'\n    ])\n    respect_robots: bool = True\n    use_proxy: bool = False\n    proxy_list: List[str] = field(default_factory=list)\n    output_dir: str = \"crawled_data\"\n    output_format: str = \"json\"\n    enable_javascript: bool = False\n    timeout_multiplier: float = 1.5\n\nclass ContentExtractor(HTMLParser):\n    \"\"\"HTML内容提取器 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.reset()\n        self.text = []\n        self.ignore = False\n        self.current_tag = \"\"\n        \n    def handle_starttag(self, tag, attrs):\n        self.current_tag = tag\n        if tag in ['script', 'style', 'noscript', 'meta', 'link']:\n            self.ignore = True\n            \n    def handle_endtag(self, tag):\n        if tag in ['script', 'style', 'noscript', 'meta', 'link']:\n            self.ignore = False\n        if tag in ['p', 'br', 'div', 'section', 'article']:\n            self.text.append('\\n')\n            \n    def handle_data(self, data):\n        if not self.ignore and data.strip():\n            self.text.append(data.strip())\n            \n    def get_text(self):\n        return ' '.join(self.text)\n\nclass MCPCrawler:\n    \"\"\"MCP 网页爬虫 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n    \n    def __init__(self, config: CrawlConfig = None):\n        self.config = config or CrawlConfig()\n        self.session: Optional[aiohttp.ClientSession] = None\n        self.visited_urls: Set[str] = set()\n        self.to_crawl: deque = deque()\n        self.crawled_data: Dict[str, Dict] = {}\n        self.robots_parsers: Dict[str, urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser] = {}\n        self.domain_counters: Dict[str, int] = {}\n        self.proxy_index: int = 0\n        self.total_crawled: int = 0\n        self.start_time: float = time.time()\n        \n        # 编译排除模式\n        self.excluded_patterns = [re.compile(pattern, re.IGNORECASE) for pattern in self.config.excluded_patterns]\n        \n    async def init_session(self):\n        \"\"\"初始化 aiohttp 会话 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        ssl_context = ssl.create_default_context()\n        ssl_context.check_hostname = False\n        ssl_context.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE\n        \n        connector = aiohttp.TCPConnector(\n            ssl=ssl_context,\n            limit=self.config.max_concurrent * 2,\n            limit_per_host=2\n        )\n        \n        self.session = aiohttp.ClientSession(\n            headers={'User-Agent': self.config.user_agent},\n            timeout=aiohttp.ClientTimeout(total=self.config.request_timeout),\n            connector=connector\n        )\n    \n    async def close_session(self):\n        \"\"\"关闭会话 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if self.session:\n            await self.session.close()\n    \n    def get_next_proxy(self) -> Optional[str]:\n        \"\"\"获取下一个代理服务器 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if not self.config.use_proxy or not self.config.proxy_list:\n            return None\n            \n        proxy = self.config.proxy_list[self.proxy_index]\n        self.proxy_index = (self.proxy_index + 1) % len(self.config.proxy_list)\n        return proxy\n    \n    async def fetch_robots_txt(self, domain: str) -> Optional[urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser]:\n        \"\"\"获取并解析 robots.txt - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if domain in self.robots_parsers:\n            return self.robots_parsers[domain]\n        \n        robots_url = f\"{domain}/robots.txt\"\n        robots_parser = urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser()\n        \n        try:\n            async with self.session.get(robots_url) as response:\n                if response.status == 200:\n                    content = await response.text()\n                    robots_parser.parse(content.splitlines())\n                    self.robots_parsers[domain] = robots_parser\n                    logger.info(f\"成功解析 robots.txt: {domain}\")\n                    return robots_parser\n                else:\n                    logger.info(f\"robots.txt 不存在或无法访问: {robots_url}\")\n                    robots_parser.parse([\"User-agent: *\", \"Disallow:\"])\n                    self.robots_parsers[domain] = robots_parser\n                    return robots_parser\n        except Exception as e:\n            logger.warning(f\"获取 robots.txt 失败: {robots_url} - {e}\")\n            robots_parser.parse([\"User-agent: *\", \"Disallow:\"])\n            self.robots_parsers[domain] = robots_parser\n            return robots_parser\n    \n    def is_allowed_by_robots(self, url: str, robots_parser: urllib.robotparser.RobotFileParser) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"检查URL是否被robots.txt允许 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if not self.config.respect_robots:\n            return True\n        return robots_parser.can_fetch(self.config.user_agent, url)\n    \n    def should_crawl(self, url: str, current_domain: str, depth: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"判断是否应该爬取该URL - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if url in self.visited_urls:\n            return False\n            \n        if depth > self.config.max_depth:\n            return False\n            \n        if self.total_crawled >= self.config.max_pages:\n            return False\n            \n        try:\n            parsed = urlparse(url)\n        except Exception:\n            return False\n            \n        if parsed.scheme not in ('http', 'https'):\n            return False\n            \n        path = parsed.path.lower()\n        if any(path.endswith(ext) for ext in self.config.excluded_extensions):\n            return False\n            \n        if any(pattern.search(url) for pattern in self.excluded_patterns):\n            return False\n            \n        if self.config.allowed_domains:\n            if parsed.netloc not in self.config.allowed_domains:\n                return False\n        else:\n            if parsed.netloc != urlparse(current_domain).netloc:\n                return False\n                \n        domain = parsed.netloc\n        if domain in self.domain_counters and self.domain_counters[domain] >= 50:\n            logger.info(f\"达到域名爬取限制: {domain}\")\n            return False\n            \n        return True\n    \n    async def fetch_url(self, url: str, retry_count: int = 0) -> Optional[Tuple[str, str]]:\n        \"\"\"获取URL内容 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        try:\n            delay = random.uniform(*self.config.delay_range)\n            await asyncio.sleep(delay)\n            \n            proxy = self.get_next_proxy()\n            \n            request_options = {\n                'url': url,\n                'proxy': proxy,\n                'headers': {\n                    'User-Agent': self.config.user_agent,\n                    'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8',\n                    'Accept-Language': 'en-US,en;q=0.5',\n                    'Accept-Encoding': 'gzip, deflate',\n                    'Connection': 'keep-alive',\n                    'Upgrade-Insecure-Requests': '1',\n                },\n                'timeout': self.config.request_timeout * self.config.timeout_multiplier,\n                'ssl': False\n            }\n            \n            async with self.session.get(**request_options) as response:\n                if response.status == 200:\n                    content_type = response.headers.get('Content-Type', '')\n                    content = await response.read()\n                    \n                    encoding = None\n                    if 'charset=' in content_type:\n                        encoding = re.search(r'charset=([\\w-]+)', content_type, re.IGNORECASE)\n                        if encoding:\n                            encoding = encoding.group(1)\n                    \n                    if not encoding:\n                        detected = chardet.detect(content)\n                        encoding = detected['encoding'] if detected['confidence'] > 0.7 else 'utf-8'\n                    \n                    try:\n                        html_content = content.decode(encoding, errors='replace')\n                    except (UnicodeDecodeError, LookupError):\n                        html_content = content.decode('utf-8', errors='replace')\n                    \n                    return html_content, response.url.human_repr()\n                else:\n                    logger.warning(f\"HTTP {response.status} 获取: {url}\")\n                    return None\n                    \n        except asyncio.TimeoutError:\n            logger.warning(f\"请求超时: {url}\")\n        except aiohttp.ClientError as e:\n            logger.warning(f\"客户端错误: {url} - {e}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            logger.error(f\"获取URL时出错: {url} - {e}\")\n            \n        if retry_count < self.config.max_retries:\n            logger.info(f\"重试 {retry_count + 1}/{self.config.max_retries}: {url}\")\n            await asyncio.sleep(2 ** retry_count)\n            return await self.fetch_url(url, retry_count + 1)\n            \n        return None\n    \n    def extract_links(self, html: str, base_url: str) -> List[str]:\n        \"\"\"从HTML中提取链接 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        soup = BeautifulSoup(html, 'html.parser')\n        links = []\n        \n        for link in soup.find_all('a', href=True):\n            href = link['href'].strip()\n            if href and not href.startswith(('javascript:', 'mailto:', 'tel:', '#')):\n                try:\n                    absolute_url = urljoin(base_url, href)\n                    absolute_url = urldefrag(absolute_url)[0]\n                    \n                    parsed = urlparse(absolute_url)\n                    if not parsed.netloc:\n                        continue\n                        \n                    normalized = parsed._replace(\n                        fragment=\"\", \n                        query=\"\",\n                        path=re.sub(r'/+', '/', parsed.path)\n                    ).geturl()\n                    \n                    if not parsed.path:\n                        normalized = normalized.rstrip('/') + '/'\n                    \n                    links.append(normalized)\n                except Exception as e:\n                    logger.warning(f\"处理链接时出错: {href} - {e}\")\n                    continue\n                \n        return links\n    \n    def extract_content(self, html: str, url: str) -> Dict:\n        \"\"\"从HTML中提取内容 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        soup = BeautifulSoup(html, 'html.parser')\n        \n        title = soup.find('title')\n        title_text = title.get_text().strip() if title else \"\"\n        \n        meta_description = \"\"\n        meta = soup.find('meta', attrs={'name': 'description'})\n        if meta and meta.get('content'):\n            meta_description = meta.get('content').strip()\n        \n        meta_keywords = \"\"\n        meta = soup.find('meta', attrs={'name': 'keywords'})\n        if meta and meta.get('content'):\n            meta_keywords = meta.get('content').strip()\n        \n        extractor = ContentExtractor()\n        extractor.feed(html)\n        text = extractor.get_text()\n        \n        if not text.strip():\n            for script in soup([\"script\", \"style\", \"nav\", \"footer\", \"aside\", \"header\", \"form\"]):\n                script.decompose()\n            \n            text = soup.get_text()\n            lines = (line.strip() for line in text.splitlines())\n            chunks = (phrase.strip() for line in lines for phrase in line.split(\"  \"))\n            text = ' '.join(chunk for chunk in chunks if chunk)\n        \n        content_hash = hashlib.md5(text.encode('utf-8')).hexdigest()\n        \n        return {\n            'url': url,\n            'title': title_text,\n            'content': text,\n            'content_hash': content_hash,\n            'meta_description': meta_description,\n            'meta_keywords': meta_keywords,\n            'timestamp': time.time(),\n            'crawl_time': time.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\n        }\n    \n    async def crawl_page(self, url: str, depth: int = 0) -> None:\n        \"\"\"爬取单个页面 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if depth > self.config.max_depth or self.total_crawled >= self.config.max_pages:\n            return\n            \n        try:\n            parsed = urlparse(url)\n            domain = f\"{parsed.scheme}://{parsed.netloc}\"\n        except Exception as e:\n            logger.warning(f\"URL解析失败: {url} - {e}\")\n            return\n            \n        robots_parser = await self.fetch_robots_txt(domain)\n        if not self.is_allowed_by_robots(url, robots_parser):\n            logger.info(f\"被robots.txt禁止: {url}\")\n            return\n            \n        result = await self.fetch_url(url)\n        if not result:\n            return\n            \n        html, final_url = result\n        url = final_url\n        \n        if url in self.visited_urls:\n            return\n            \n        content_data = self.extract_content(html, url)\n        \n        content_hash = content_data['content_hash']\n        for crawled_url, crawled_data in self.crawled_data.items():\n            if crawled_data.get('content_hash') == content_hash:\n                logger.info(f\"跳过重复内容: {url} (与 {crawled_url} 相同)\")\n                return\n        \n        self.crawled_data[url] = content_data\n        self.visited_urls.add(url)\n        self.total_crawled += 1\n        \n        if domain in self.domain_counters:\n            self.domain_counters[domain] += 1\n        else:\n            self.domain_counters[domain] = 1\n        \n        logger.info(f\"已爬取 [{depth}/{self.config.max_depth}]: {url} - 标题: {content_data['title'][:50]}...\")\n        \n        if depth < self.config.max_depth and self.total_crawled < self.config.max_pages:\n            links = self.extract_links(html, url)\n            for link in links:\n                if self.should_crawl(link, domain, depth + 1):\n                    self.to_crawl.append((link, depth + 1))\n    \n    async def run(self, start_urls: List[str]) -> Dict[str, Dict]:\n        \"\"\"运行爬虫 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        await self.init_session()\n        \n        for url in start_urls:\n            if self.should_crawl(url, url, 0):\n                self.to_crawl.append((url, 0))\n        \n        semaphore = asyncio.Semaphore(self.config.max_concurrent)\n        \n        async def limited_crawl(url, depth):\n            async with semaphore:\n                await self.crawl_page(url, depth)\n        \n        tasks = set()\n        while self.to_crawl and self.total_crawled < self.config.max_pages:\n            url, depth = self.to_crawl.popleft()\n            \n            task = asyncio.create_task(limited_crawl(url, depth))\n            tasks.add(task)\n            task.add_done_callback(tasks.discard)\n            \n            if len(tasks) >= self.config.max_concurrent:\n                await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n        \n        if tasks:\n            await asyncio.wait(tasks)\n        \n        await self.close_session()\n        \n        elapsed_time = time.time() - self.start_time\n        stats = {\n            'total_crawled': self.total_crawled,\n            'elapsed_time': elapsed_time,\n            'pages_per_second': self.total_crawled / elapsed_time if elapsed_time > 0 else 0,\n            'domains_crawled': len(self.domain_counters),\n            'completion_time': time.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')\n        }\n        \n        logger.info(f\"爬取完成! 共获取 {self.total_crawled} 个页面, 耗时 {elapsed_time:.2f} 秒\")\n        logger.info(f\"平均速度: {stats['pages_per_second']:.2f} 页/秒\")\n        \n        result = {\n            'metadata': stats,\n            'pages': self.crawled_data\n        }\n        \n        return result\n    \n    def save_results(self, data: Dict, format: str = None) -> List[str]:\n        \"\"\"保存爬取结果 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n        if format is None:\n            format = self.config.output_format\n            \n        os.makedirs(self.config.output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n        saved_files = []\n        \n        timestamp = int(time.time())\n        \n        if format == 'json' or format == 'both':\n            output_path = os.path.join(self.config.output_dir, f'crawled_data_{timestamp}.json')\n            with open(output_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                json.dump(data, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n            logger.info(f\"JSON结果已保存到: {output_path}\")\n            saved_files.append(output_path)\n        \n        if format == 'text' or format == 'both':\n            text_dir = os.path.join(self.config.output_dir, f'text_{timestamp}')\n            os.makedirs(text_dir, exist_ok=True)\n            \n            for url, content in data['pages'].items():\n                parsed = urlparse(url)\n                path = parsed.path\n                if not path or path == '/':\n                    filename = 'index.txt'\n                else:\n                    filename = path[1:].replace('/', '_').replace('.', '_')\n                    if not filename:\n                        filename = 'index'\n                    filename += '.txt'\n                \n                if len(filename) > 100:\n                    name, ext = os.path.splitext(filename)\n                    filename = name[:95] + ext\n                \n                output_path = os.path.join(text_dir, filename)\n                \n                try:\n                    with open(output_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                        f.write(f\"URL: {url}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"标题: {content['title']}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"描述: {content['meta_description']}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"关键词: {content['meta_keywords']}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"爬取时间: {content['crawl_time']}\\n\")\n                        f.write(\"-\" * 80 + \"\\n\")\n                        f.write(content['content'])\n                except Exception as e:\n                    logger.error(f\"保存文件失败 {output_path}: {e}\")\n                    backup_name = hashlib.md5(url.encode()).hexdigest()[:10] + '.txt'\n                    backup_path = os.path.join(text_dir, backup_name)\n                    with open(backup_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                        f.write(f\"URL: {url}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"标题: {content['title']}\\n\")\n                        f.write(f\"内容: {content['content']}\\n\")\n            \n            logger.info(f\"文本结果已保存到目录: {text_dir}\")\n            saved_files.append(text_dir)\n            \n        return saved_files\n\ndef parse_arguments():\n    \"\"\"解析命令行参数 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description='MCP网页内容爬虫')\n    parser.add_argument('urls', nargs='+', help='要爬取的起始URL')\n    parser.add_argument('-c', '--concurrent', type=int, default=10, help='最大并发数')\n    parser.add_argument('-d', '--depth', type=int, default=3, help='最大爬取深度')\n    parser.add_argument('-p', '--pages', type=int, default=100, help='最大爬取页面数')\n    parser.add_argument('-o', '--output', default='crawled_data', help='输出目录')\n    parser.add_argument('-f', '--format', choices=['json', 'text', 'both'], default='json', help='输出格式')\n    parser.add_argument('--delay-min', type=float, default=1.0, help='最小延迟(秒)')\n    parser.add_argument('--delay-max', type=float, default=3.0, help='最大延迟(秒)')\n    parser.add_argument('--timeout', type=int, default=30, help='请求超时时间(秒)')\n    parser.add_argument('--retries', type=int, default=3, help='最大重试次数')\n    parser.add_argument('--no-robots', action='store_true', help='不遵守robots.txt')\n    parser.add_argument('--domains', nargs='+', help='允许的域名列表')\n    parser.add_argument('--proxy', nargs='+', help='代理服务器列表')\n    parser.add_argument('--user-agent', help='自定义User-Agent')\n    parser.add_argument('-v', '--verbose', action='store_true', help='详细输出')\n    \n    return parser.parse_args()\n\nasync def main():\n    \"\"\"主函数 - 完整实现\"\"\"\n    args = parse_arguments()\n    \n    if args.verbose:\n        logging.getLogger().setLevel(logging.DEBUG)\n    \n    config = CrawlConfig(\n        user_agent=args.user_agent or \"MCP-Crawler/1.0\",\n        max_concurrent=args.concurrent,\n        request_timeout=args.timeout,\n        delay_range=(args.delay_min, args.delay_max),\n        max_retries=args.retries,\n        max_depth=args.depth,\n        max_pages=args.pages,\n      